  "name": "hints",
  "description": "A cryptographic library for computing and verifying weighted threshold signatures using the arkworks ecosystem. It implements a scheme based on KZG10 polynomial commitments over the BLS12-381 pairing-friendly curve to enable efficient proving of committee-based weight distributions. The system utilizes structured reference strings and polynomial arithmetic to generate succinct proofs of threshold attainment.",
